@startuml RF5_Componentes
title RF5 — Criar um esquema de vestimenta na aba "Criar Look"\nDiagrama de componentes — gerado do código (controllers → serviços → repositórios/ports)
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  BorderColor #4A4852
  ArrowColor #4A4852
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #CBC6BE
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #EEF6FF
  BorderColor #4A4852
}
left to right direction

package "Frontend (Next.js)" {
  component "schemes/new — Criar Look" as FE0
  component "SchemeBuilder\n(components/scheme-builder.tsx)" as FE1
  component "SchemeCard + scheme-anatomies" as FE2
}
package "fai-web · controllers" {
  [SchemeController] as SchemeController
  [BackgroundController\n(RF11)] as BackgroundController
}
package "fai-application · services" {
  [SchemeService] as SchemeService
  [WardrobeService\n(eligible: só peças disponíveis)] as WardrobeService
  [BackgroundStudioService\n(RF11)] as BackgroundStudioService
  [SealService\n(RF20/RF21)] as SealService
  [SchemeCardRenderer\n(imaging)] as Renderer
  [LocalSchemeComposer\n(fallback local)] as LocalComposer
  [AiEngine (RF24)] as AiEngine #FAFAFA
}
package "fai-domain · repository (JPA)" {
  [SchemeRepository\nSchemeItemRepository\nWardrobeItemRepository\nUserRepository\nStyleDnaRepository] as REPOS
}
database "MySQL\n• schemes\n• scheme_items\n• wardrobe_items\n• users\n• style_dna" as DB
cloud "Provedores de IA\n(fai-infrastructure · ai-providers)" as P_ai
component "Storage de mídia\n(MediaService / storage-s3)" as P_storage
[Eventos de domínio\nSchemeSaved (AFTER_COMMIT)\n→ FAI Points (RF30), Inventory Score (RF29)] as P_events

FE0 --> FE1 : renderiza
FE1 --> SchemeController : GET /api/schemes/builder\nPOST /api/schemes/compositions\nPOST /api/schemes/preview\nPOST /api/schemes
FE1 --> BackgroundController : GET /api/backgrounds/recommendations\nPOST /api/backgrounds/art
FE2 --> SchemeController : GET /api/schemes/{id}/card.png
SchemeController --> SchemeService : chama
BackgroundController --> BackgroundStudioService : chama
SchemeService --> WardrobeService : lê peças elegíveis (CA01/CA07b)
SchemeService --> BackgroundStudioService : aplica arte (etapa 4)
SchemeService --> SealService : suggestSealsAfterSave (RF20)
SchemeService --> Renderer : renderiza card/preview
SchemeService --> AiEngine : compor 3 looks (CA04)
SchemeService --> LocalComposer : fallback sem IA
SchemeService --> REPOS : grava schemes + scheme_items
SchemeService --> P_storage : foto do look (POST /api/schemes/photos)
SchemeService --> P_events : publica SchemeSaved
AiEngine ..> P_ai : chama
REPOS --> DB : JPA/Flyway

note bottom of SchemeService
  CA02: eligible < 2 → status INSUFICIENTE e ação /pieces/new (RF4)
  CA06: items vazio → 400 SEM_PECAS
  CA05: publish=true → status PUBLISHED e feed (RF8), ver /publication
end note
@enduml
